WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.000 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
Recreation & Meals

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:37.350 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
As newborn babes, long for
the guileless milk of the
word.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:40.600 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
Turn to the Lord within
you. You have to learn to
realize,

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.300 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
Oh Lord, You're inside of
me.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.450 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
When these kids are saying
things to me, You're inside
of me.

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:51.320 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
How does a child of God
respond to things?

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:54.100 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
I was saved in sixth grade,
like many of you all.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:57.590 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
I did not know the way to
go on in my Christian life.

00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:59.500 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
I thought I was saved, and
that's it.

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:01.700 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
But I always searched for
something deeper.

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:03.530 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
I wanted something more in
my life.

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:06.950 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
I wanted a life of meaning.
I wanted a life of purpose.

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:10.010 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
That is where the real joy
is.

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:13.610 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
I was searching for
success. I was searching
for money.

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:15.450 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
I was searching for a
career,

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:17.050 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
and none of those things
satisfy,

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:19.100 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
because we are made in
God's image.

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:21.850 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
So we are made to contain
and to express God.

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:24.410 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
So if we're not being
filled with God,

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:26.550 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
we're not going to be
satisfied,

00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:28.250 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
and God is not going to be
satisfied.

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:31.000 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
Your highlight of the
Summer School of Truth?

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:34.650 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
Being together with the
saints.

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:36.000 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
Alright! How about you?

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:37.500 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
I like the songs.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.500 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
There's just a lot of
people singing,

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:42.930 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
and you can feel the Lord's
presence. It's really nice.

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:44.700 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
Great! Would you come back?

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:45.200 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
Yes!

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:46.400 line:75% position:50% align:center size:92%
Awesome!
